{%- comment -%}
  Arkorra Design System head assets (ADR-0001).
  Loaded once from layout/theme.liquid.

  Icons: Material Symbols is loaded as a subset (`icon_names`, alphabetical)
  to keep the font tiny. To use a new icon in a section/block setting,
  add its name to `ark_icon_names` below (keep alphabetical order).
{%- endcomment -%}
